{"id":"wb-7-1118","name":"羊角水堡","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"羊角水堡","text":"羊角水堡位于中国江西省赣州市会昌县筠门岭镇羊角村，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n羊角水堡是一座保存比较完整、规模宏大的军民共戎的明代乡村军事城堡，始建于明嘉靖二十三年（1544年）。目前羊角水堡城墙仅北部被毁，大部分城段尚存，保存有明代城墙861米，三座城门基本完好，以东城门保存最为完整。2015年9月已正式启动羊角水堡的修缮工作。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%8A%E8%A7%92%E6%B0%B4%E5%A0%A1","revisionId":86474899,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86474899","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9a59fc69f50275e7d411b234.jpg","title":"Huichang_Yangjiaoshuibao_2018.10.06_17-13-45.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Huichang_Yangjiaoshuibao_2018.10.06_17-13-45.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/Huichang_Yangjiaoshuibao_2018.10.06_17-13-45.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"羊角水堡","width":320,"height":240}}